{"id":"t18111","key":"bride of re animator|1990","csv":{"title":"Bride of Re-Animator","year":1990,"directors":["Brian Yuzna"],"rating":5,"watchedDate":"2021-10-03"},"status":"ok","tmdb":{"tmdbId":18111,"imdbId":"tt0099180","wikidataId":"Q913558","title":"Re-Animator II","originalTitle":"Bride of Re-Animator","altTitles":["Re-Animator 2","La novia de Re-Animator","La fiancée du réanimateur","A Noiva do Re-Animator","Re-Animator II - La Fiancée de Re-Animator","H.P. Lovecraft's Bride of Re-Animator","死霊のしたたり２","리애니메이터의 신부","리애니메이터 2","Реаниматор 2"],"tagline":"Jusqu'à ce que la mort nous sépare...","overview":"5 ans se sont écoulés depuis les terribles évènements qui ont secoué la petite ville d'Arkham : des morts, ramenés à la vie par un étrange sérum, avaient massacré le personnel de l'hopital. Le docteur Herbert West, inventeur de ce sérum, s'est réfugié dans un pays d'Amérique du Sud, où la guerre fait rage : les circonstances sont idéales pour tester le nouveau sérum de vie qu'il a mis au point...","overviewLang":"fr","releaseDate":"1990-09-01","runtime":92,"status":"Released","genres":["Horreur","Comédie","Science-Fiction"],"genreIds":[27,35,878],"countries":["United States of America"],"originCountry":["US"],"languages":["English","Italiano"],"originalLanguage":"en","directors":["Brian Yuzna"],"directorIds":[27992],"writers":["Woody Keith","Rick Fry","Brian Yuzna"],"composers":["Richard Band"],"cinematographers":["Rick Fichter"],"editors":["Peter Teschner"],"producers":["Brian Yuzna"],"cast":[{"id":27993,"name":"Jeffrey Combs","character":"Dr. Herbert West","profilePath":"/dfWcxKNsyGuN18GjWkbOmMhO4c9.jpg"},{"id":27994,"name":"Bruce Abbott","character":"Dr. Dan Cain","profilePath":"/9a2ve1mVCCEeO9GTR55UlC566wD.jpg"},{"id":82684,"name":"Claude Earl Jones","character":"Lt. Leslie Chapham","profilePath":"/5xK538SKUTMG3dYjPk0eJXhN214.jpg"},{"id":13923,"name":"Fabiana Udenio","character":"Francesca Danelli","profilePath":"/h0X8ZywuhsqdYpqy6dNiXaOG7XM.jpg"},{"id":279